{"id":"n87065-1-8","stage":1,"title":"환전 · 兑换","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n87065-1-8-1","ko":"이 은행에서 환전도 할 수 있나요?","zh":"这家银行可以兑换货币吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"은행에서","meaning":"银行","explanation":"은행：银行；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"은행","audio":"/audio/9630c6227715da131d3e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71109","senseId":"1","lemma":"은행","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"은행에서","audio":"/audio/f51fc9c42b5b41abb2ad.mp3"}},{"text":"환전도","meaning":"兑换，换钱","explanation":"환전：兑换，换钱；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"환전","audio":"/audio/f1db393365c32ad97ee7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87065","senseId":"1","lemma":"환전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"환전도","audio":"/audio/ef1a34fb7dbc3593ff27.mp3"}},{"text":"할","meaning":"办理，处置，分配","explanation":"하다：办理，处置，分配；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"13","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"할","audio":"/audio/3b4c012b3f82dedb34a0.mp3"}},{"text":"수","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}},{"text":"있나요?","meaning":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","explanation":"있다：能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"5","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있나요","audio":"/audio/0eb260e471116d837abb.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"9630c6227715da13","term":"은행","zh":"银行","audio":"/audio/9630c6227715da131d3e.mp3","entryId":"71109","definition":"负责管理人们的钱并把钱借给需要的人的机构。","pronunciation":["은행"]},{"id":"f1db393365c32ad9","term":"환전","zh":"兑换，换钱","audio":"/audio/f1db393365c32ad97ee7.mp3","entryId":"87065","definition":"把一国的货币换与另一国的货币对换。","pronunciation":["환ː전"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"办理，处置，分配","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"处理事情或问题。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/7038bc50f27fcedfd160.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n87065-1-8-2","ko":"그럼요. 어느 나라 화폐로 교환하실 건가요?","zh":"当然可以。您想把钱兑换成哪个国家的货币呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그럼요.","meaning":"当然、那是当然","explanation":"그럼요：当然、那是当然","readings":[{"term":"그럼요","audio":"/audio/ef69d4f567549e5e73e3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"course:그럼요:1","senseId":"1","lemma":"그럼요","origin":"course-authored supplement"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그럼요","audio":"/audio/ef69d4f567549e5e73e3.mp3"}},{"text":"어느","meaning":"哪，哪个","explanation":"어느：哪，哪个","readings":[{"term":"어느","audio":"/audio/76e7139b030308e75b1c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62822","senseId":"3","lemma":"어느","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어느","audio":"/audio/76e7139b030308e75b1c.mp3"}},{"text":"나라","meaning":"国，国家","explanation":"나라：国，国家","readings":[{"term":"나라","audio":"/audio/02faec8ed1c75703dcd3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29699","senseId":"1","lemma":"나라","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나라","audio":"/audio/02faec8ed1c75703dcd3.mp3"}},{"text":"화폐로","meaning":"货币","explanation":"화폐：货币；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"화폐","audio":"/audio/48c404b2388dfdbd4381.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87697","senseId":"1","lemma":"화폐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"화폐로","audio":"/audio/28577bf0f66e5c67cf6a.mp3"}},{"text":"교환하실","meaning":"调换，交换","explanation":"교환하다：调换，交换；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"교환하다","audio":"/audio/41a806c0ef662aae8dc0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24078","senseId":"1","lemma":"교환하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"교환하실","audio":"/audio/b0a20eb13cca0dcdd27b.mp3"}},{"text":"건가요?","meaning":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ가요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"4","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"건가요","audio":"/audio/d23ae34a616ec8bb1263.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ef69d4f567549e5e","term":"그럼요","zh":"当然、那是当然","audio":"/audio/ef69d4f567549e5e73e3.mp3","definition":"礼貌地肯定对方的问题或说法。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"76e7139b030308e7","term":"어느","zh":"哪，哪个","audio":"/audio/76e7139b030308e75b1c.mp3","entryId":"62822","definition":"不管任何人或物。","pronunciation":["어느"]},{"id":"02faec8ed1c75703","term":"나라","zh":"国，国家","audio":"/audio/02faec8ed1c75703dcd3.mp3","entryId":"29699","definition":"拥有一定领土与主权的、由居民组成的社会性组织。","pronunciation":["나라"]},{"id":"48c404b2388dfdbd","term":"화폐","zh":"货币","audio":"/audio/48c404b2388dfdbd4381.mp3","entryId":"87697","definition":"买卖商品或与其他商品交换时，作为衡量商品价值的基准，可以作为商品交换手段的东西。","pronunciation":["화ː폐","화ː페"]},{"id":"41a806c0ef662aae","term":"교환하다","zh":"调换，交换","audio":"